            "detailed_description": "Generation Zero passa-se no mundo aberto familiar mas hostil de Östertörn, na Suécia. O teu outrora pacífico lar foi tomado por misteriosas e mortíferas máquinas inimigas. Deves escolher bem as tuas batalhas ao envolver-te em combate de guerrilha cheio de adrenalina contra as forças mecânicas.<br><br><strong>[Explora um Mundo Aberto Hostil[/b]<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/704270/extras/d47d1b1d03793763d0e9cf826b473968.poster.avif?t=1790320635\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/704270/extras/d47d1b1d03793763d0e9cf826b473968.webm?t=1790320635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/704270/extras/d47d1b1d03793763d0e9cf826b473968.mp4?t=1790320635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Explora um mapa massivo inspirado na era da Guerra Fria Sueca onde o perigo espreita em cada rua, em cada floresta e dentro de cada bunker.<br><br><strong>Começa uma Guerra de Guerrilha</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/704270/extras/4d33aeb6ead4ef04244d4239b0ac0426.poster.avif?t=1790320635\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/704270/extras/4d33aeb6ead4ef04244d4239b0ac0426.webm?t=1790320635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/704270/extras/4d33aeb6ead4ef04244d4239b0ac0426.mp4?t=1790320635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Envolve-te em complicadas batalhas contra máquinas sofisticadas e mortíferas. Enfrenta-as sozinho ou em grupo, com até três amigos. Será que consegues vencer um inimigo implacável, feito para te perseguir?<br><br><strong>Fica mais Forte</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/704270/extras/529f6c23ae5370091cfdd7e0139a5b70.poster.avif?t=1790320635\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/704270/extras/529f6c23ae5370091cfdd7e0139a5b70.webm?t=1790320635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/704270/extras/529f6c23ae5370091cfdd7e0139a5b70.mp4?t=1790320635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Fica mais forte enquanto ganhas experiência a combater contra as máquinas. Vasculha peças dos teus inimigos derrotados e usa-as para criar equipamento, armas e munição. Constrói e fortifica as tuas próprias bases à volta da ilha e retoma o teu lar!<br><br><strong>Descobre o Mistério Por Trás das Máquinas</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/704270/extras/6183833e66dda821d8ce897081fe8488.poster.avif?t=1790320635\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/704270/extras/6183833e66dda821d8ce897081fe8488.webm?t=1790320635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/704270/extras/6183833e66dda821d8ce897081fe8488.mp4?t=1790320635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Descobre a verdade sobre o que realmente aconteceu na região de Östertörn.</strong>",
            "about_the_game": "Generation Zero passa-se no mundo aberto familiar mas hostil de Östertörn, na Suécia. O teu outrora pacífico lar foi tomado por misteriosas e mortíferas máquinas inimigas. Deves escolher bem as tuas batalhas ao envolver-te em combate de guerrilha cheio de adrenalina contra as forças mecânicas.<br><br><strong>[Explora um Mundo Aberto Hostil[/b]<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/704270/extras/d47d1b1d03793763d0e9cf826b473968.poster.avif?t=1790320635\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/704270/extras/d47d1b1d03793763d0e9cf826b473968.webm?t=1790320635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/704270/extras/d47d1b1d03793763d0e9cf826b473968.mp4?t=1790320635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Explora um mapa massivo inspirado na era da Guerra Fria Sueca onde o perigo espreita em cada rua, em cada floresta e dentro de cada bunker.<br><br><strong>Começa uma Guerra de Guerrilha</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/704270/extras/4d33aeb6ead4ef04244d4239b0ac0426.poster.avif?t=1790320635\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/704270/extras/4d33aeb6ead4ef04244d4239b0ac0426.webm?t=1790320635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/704270/extras/4d33aeb6ead4ef04244d4239b0ac0426.mp4?t=1790320635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Envolve-te em complicadas batalhas contra máquinas sofisticadas e mortíferas. Enfrenta-as sozinho ou em grupo, com até três amigos. Será que consegues vencer um inimigo implacável, feito para te perseguir?<br><br><strong>Fica mais Forte</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/704270/extras/529f6c23ae5370091cfdd7e0139a5b70.poster.avif?t=1790320635\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/704270/extras/529f6c23ae5370091cfdd7e0139a5b70.webm?t=1790320635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/704270/extras/529f6c23ae5370091cfdd7e0139a5b70.mp4?t=1790320635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Fica mais forte enquanto ganhas experiência a combater contra as máquinas. Vasculha peças dos teus inimigos derrotados e usa-as para criar equipamento, armas e munição. Constrói e fortifica as tuas próprias bases à volta da ilha e retoma o teu lar!<br><br><strong>Descobre o Mistério Por Trás das Máquinas</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/704270/extras/6183833e66dda821d8ce897081fe8488.poster.avif?t=1790320635\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/704270/extras/6183833e66dda821d8ce897081fe8488.webm?t=1790320635\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/704270/extras/6183833e66dda821d8ce897081fe8488.mp4?t=1790320635\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Descobre a verdade sobre o que realmente aconteceu na região de Östertörn.</strong>",
